// AWS Security Hub Disabled or Weakened  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1562.008
// Detects disabling Security Hub or its standards/findings (DisableSecurityHub, BatchDisableStandards, DeleteInsight, UpdateStandardsControl…
// False positives: Planned Security Hub administration.
// Source: rules/defense-evasion/securityhub-disable.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^DisableSecurityHub$/i or eventName=/^BatchDisableStandards$/i or eventName=/^DeleteInsight$/i eventSource=/^securityhub\.amazonaws\.com$/i
